{title: Your Word Is Truth}
{subtitle: John 17:17}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 85}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Bb] | [F/A] | [Eb/G] | [Bb] [F/A] |
| [Eb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]I have given them [Eb]your word to hold
[Gm7]The world has hated them, I am told
[Bb]They are not of the world, [Eb]just as I
[Gm7]The truth of heaven [Eb]stands before their eye
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
[Cm7]I do not ask [Gm7]you to take them out
[F]But to keep them from the evil one's doubt
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb]Sanc[F/A]tify them in [Eb]the truth
Your word [Bb]is truth
Sanc[F/A]tify them in [Eb]the truth
Your word [Gm7]is [F]truth [Eb]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Bb]As you sent me into the world
[Gm7]So I have sent [Eb]them, calm and mild [Bb]
For their [Eb]sake I sancti[Gm7]fy myself
So that they too may [Eb]be whole and self
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb]Sancti[F/A]fy them in the [Eb]truth
Your word [Bb]is truth
Sanc[F/A]tify them in [Eb]the truth
Your word [Gm7]is [F]truth [Eb]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Cm]I do not pray [Gm7]for these alone
[F]But for those who [Eb]will believe through their song
[Cm]Through their word [Gm7]the faith comes in
[F]A new light for [Eb]the world to be[Bb]gin
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Sancti[F/A]fy them in the [Eb]truth
Your word is [Bb]truth
Sanc[F/A]tify them in [Eb]the truth
Your word is [Gm7][F]truth
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Outro}
| [Eb] | [Bb] [F/A] | [Eb] | [Bb] [F/A] |
| [Eb] | [Eb] |
